    "name": "Pickled Jalapenos",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sweet Creek is proud of their jalapenos, they are crisp and deliciously spicy. Slice them up for your omelettes in the morning, add them to your soup at lunch, and put them in you chili or burritos at dinner. At Sweet Creek it's always jalapeno time! A little bit of agave sweetness to compliment the spice of the jalapenos, sure to please jalapeno fans. They are excellent on nachos and in chili.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients:Organic Jalapeno Peppers, Filtered Water, Organic Apple Cider Vinegar, Organic Carrots, Organic Onions, Organic Agave, Sea Salt, Organic Garlic, Organic Oregano</span></p>",
